%% UC-34 — Comment & like habits in the explore graph (community signal -> LLM)
%% Comments are auto-moderated by a local wordlist/regex check (not an LLM
%% call — see commentModerationService.js) before being persisted.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Participant
    actor R as Researcher/Admin
    participant F as Flutter App (Explore)
    participant AF as Admin Panel
    participant B as Backend (habitsCrudRouter / adminRouter)
    participant Mod as commentModerationService<br/>(local wordlist + regex)
    participant M as MongoDB
    participant N4 as Neo4j
    participant AI as API-service (recommend)

    P->>F: Tap ♥ on a habit
    F->>B: POST /habits/:uuid/annotate {type: "like"}
    B->>M: insert(habit_annotations) — one like per user (dedup)
    B->>N4: SET h.annotations_like += 1 (counter on Habit node)
    B-->>F: updated counts {helpful, iDoThis, likes}

    P->>F: Write a comment
    F->>B: POST /habits/:uuid/comments {text}
    B->>Mod: moderateComment({text})
    Mod-->>B: {flagged, reason} (profanity/slur wordlist, or link/email/phone regex)
    alt flagged
        B->>N4: CREATE (:Comment {id, text, createdAt,<br/>flagged:true, approved:false, flagReason})-[:COMMENT_ON]->(:Habit)
    else clean
        B->>N4: CREATE (:Comment {id, text, createdAt,<br/>flagged:false, approved:true})-[:COMMENT_ON]->(:Habit)
    end
    B->>M: insert(habit_comments {commentId, userId}) — ownership only (rate limit + GDPR erasure)
    B-->>F: 201 comment {flagged, approved}
    F->>B: GET /habits/:uuid/comments
    B->>N4: MATCH (c:Comment)-[:COMMENT_ON]->(h)<br/>WHERE c.approved = true ORDER BY createdAt DESC
    B-->>F: anonymous, approved comment list only

    Note over R,N4: Flagged-comment review (admin panel)
    R->>AF: Open Comments → "Flagged for review"
    AF->>B: GET /admin/comments?status=flagged
    B->>N4: MATCH (c:Comment) WHERE c.flagged=true AND c.approved=false
    B-->>AF: flagged comments + flagReason
    alt approve
        R->>AF: Approve
        AF->>B: POST /admin/comments/:id/approve
        B->>N4: SET c.approved=true, c.flagged=false
    else reject
        R->>AF: Delete
        AF->>B: DELETE /admin/comments/:id
        B->>N4: DETACH DELETE c
        B->>M: deleteOne(habit_comments {commentId})
    end

    Note over AI,N4: Recommendation generation (UC-07):
    AI->>N4: vector search community habits incl. coalesce(h.annotations_like, 0)
    AI->>AI: prompt includes community_likes — LLM prefers well-liked habits
